			(property "Description" "WR-TBL Serie 313 - 5.08 mm Close Horizontal PCB Header\n\nKIND PROPERTIES\n\nPitch 5.08 mm\n\nMATERIAL PROPERTIES\n\nInsulator Material PA66\nInsulator Flammability Rating UL94 V-0\nInsulator Color Green\nContact Material Brass\nContact Plating Tin\n\nGENERAL INFORMATION\n\nOperating Temperature -40 up to +105 °C\n\nELECTRICAL PROPERTIES\n\nIR cULus 20 A\nIR VDE 20 A\nWorking Voltage [cULus] 300 V (AC)\nWorking Voltage [VDE] 300 V (AC)\nWithstanding Voltage [cULus] 1600 V (AC)\nWithstanding Voltage [VDE] 2500 V (AC)\nContact Resistance [cULus] 20 mΩ\nContact Resistance [VDE] 20 mΩ\n\nCERTIFICATION\n\ncULus Approval E315414\nVDE Approval 40023195 [Model number 313]\n\nhttps://www.we-online.com/catalog/media/o33265v209%20Family_WR-TBL_6913135100xx.jpg\n\nhttps://www.we-online.com/catalog/en/TBL_5_08_313_CLOSE_HORIZONTAL_PCB_HEADER_6913135100XX/\n\nUpdated by Ella Wu  2019-12-26\n2022(C) Wurth Elektronik"
